{
  "name": "Infrastructure AI Self-Healing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "zabbix-incident",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "<id-here>",
      "name": "Zabbix Webhook Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1344,
        -352
      ],
      "webhookId": "<webhookId-here>"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict infrastructure parser. Read the Zabbix alert and output the correct Proxmox command based on the resource type by dynamically extracting the exact ID found in the text.\n\nRules:\n- If the alert is an LXC container (lxc/<ID>), format as 'pct start <ID>'.\n- If the alert is a Virtual Machine (qm/<ID>), format as 'qm start <ID>'.\n- If the alert is a general host alert (like CPU load, disk, or memory without a specific lxc/qm ID), set \"actionCommand\" to \"none\".\n\nExample 1:\nAlert: Proxmox VE: LXC [node/test (lxc/109)]: Not running\nOutput: {\"actionCommand\": \"pct start 109\"}\n\nExample 2:\nAlert: Proxmox VE: VM [node/prod (qm/205)]: Not running\nOutput: {\"actionCommand\": \"qm start 205\"}\n\nCurrent Zabbix Event Name: \n{{ $json.body.event_name }}\n\nCurrent Zabbix Message:\n{{ $json.body.message }}\n\nOutput ONLY a raw JSON object with no markdown ticks or extra text, following this exact structure (replace <ID> with the actual ID extracted from the current alert):\n{\n  \"actionCommand\": \"pct start <ID>\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an SRE AI Assistant. You analyze homelab issues and prepare remediation plans. Aftert preparing resolve the issues presented"
        }
      },
      "id": "<id-here>",
      "name": "AI Incident Analyzer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        -864,
        -368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "qwen2.5:3b",
        "options": {
          "numBatch": 1024,
          "numThread": 2
        }
      },
      "id": "<id-here>",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -864,
        -176
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "<id-here>",
          "name": "Ollama account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "<email-here>",
        "toEmail": "<email-here>",
        "subject": "={{ \"[Zabbix Auto-Remediation] Executed: \" + JSON.parse($('AI Incident Analyzer').first().json.output).actionCommand }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\">\n    [Automated Homelab Self-Healing]\n  </h2>\n  \n  <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px;\">\n    An incident was automatically detected by Zabbix, evaluated by Local AI, and processed via remote pipeline.\n  </p>\n\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; background: #fff; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n    <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n      <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; color: #333; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\" colspan=\"2\">Event Details</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #444; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><strong>Event:</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #444; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">{{ $('Zabbix Webhook Alert').first().json.body.event_name }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #444; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\" valign=\"top\"><strong>Message:</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #444; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-family: monospace; background: #fafafa;\">{{ $('Zabbix Webhook Alert').first().json.body.message }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n      <th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; color: #333; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\" colspan=\"2\">Remediation Status</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #444;\"><strong>Action Executed:</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #27ae60; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;\">\n        <code>{{ JSON.parse($('AI Incident Analyzer').first().json.output).actionCommand }}</code>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"color: #888; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px;\">\n    <em>This fix was executed automatically by your n8n homelab pipeline.</em>\n  </p>\n</div>",
        "options": {}
      },
